WEBVTT

00:11:26.196 --> 00:11:30.636
it will help if they can be clear
about their values,

00:11:30.676 --> 00:11:32.396
listen to their children

00:11:32.396 --> 00:11:34.596
and share some digital
pleasures with them.

00:11:36.036 --> 00:11:40.116
For society, I know it's easy
to criticize parents,

00:11:40.156 --> 00:11:46.076
but I’ve argued instead that we should
recognize the challenges they’re facing,

00:11:46.116 --> 00:11:48.596
that we should try to enhance
the opportunities

00:11:48.596 --> 00:11:51.636
and options available to them

00:11:51.636 --> 00:11:55.236
and that we should ask ourselves
how we can support them better.

00:11:56.316 --> 00:11:57.316
Thank you.

00:11:57.356 --> 00:12:01.916
(Applause)